	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Parts",
	"Description": "Destructible body parts for the GSTN combat: part sets (hardness, caps, transfer to the main pool), the penetration table, break effects as data, and the pure integer-quantised math that applies a hit to a part (GSTNPartsCore, no fork); the ability-system half (GSTNPartsGAS: one-shot break effects, part events, tag projection; stock GAS, no Network Prediction) and the Network Prediction half (GSTNPartsNP: the sync fragment; needs the GAS-NPP fork). Enabling it changes nothing until an entity is given a part set.",
